This project is an extension of the original "c3rb3r-btrfs-recovery" skill by
crt106 (https://github.com/crt106/c3rb3r-btrfs-recovery), also MIT licensed.
The original work covers the Btrfs extent-reconstruction route; this fork adds
the plaintext-extraction, copy-hunting and raw-device carving routes, the
Synology Drive rebuild, the OSheet container toolchain, the progress ledger,
and the delivery-verification gates.

